{'symbol': 'PPG', 'date': '2022-11-14 09:09:00', 'title': "GLIDDEN MAX FLEX SPRAY PAINT BY PPG WINS THE HOME DEPOT'S 2022 INNOVATION AWARD", 'text': 'PITTSBURGH--( BUSINESS WIRE )--PPG (NYSE: PPG) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT GLIDDEN MAX FLEX™ SPRAY PAINT AND PRIMER BY PPG WAS RECENTLY NAMED THE OVERALL WINNER OF THE HOME DEPOT 2022 INNOVATION AWARD. THE ANNUAL AWARDS RECOGNIZE PRODUCTS THAT OFFER OUTSTANDING PERFORMANCE AND EXTRAORDINARY VALUE TO CUSTOMERS, WITH THE END GOAL OF MAKING LIFE EASIER FOR PRO AND DIY SHOPPERS ALIKE.'}